<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: It was a long and quiet night when your entire life turned on its head. You are not sure if it was a deliberate sabotage by one of the family servants, a simple system malfunction or a well executed deserter strategy, but the mansion defense systems turned off as the clock struck midnight. When the gates swung wide, there was no time to call for aid - best you could do was hide.
You heard the screams of your family and mansion workers as they were being slaughtered by the deserter strike team. You vowed to have your revenge, but until you make it out of this particular situation alive, your vows are all for nothing. You can either wait the raid out, use permits to call for reinforcements, or try running for the hills - the choice is yours.-->
  <VFEE_NewFamily.scenario.parts.14.text>这是一个漫长而安静的夜晚，你的整个生活发生了翻天覆地的变化。你不确定这是否是一位家庭仆人的蓄意破坏、一个简单的系统故障或一个执行良好的逃兵策略，但当午夜钟声敲响时，宅邸的防御系统关闭了。当大门打开时，没有时间寻求援助 - 你能做的最好的事情就是躲起来。
你听到你的家人和大厦工人被逃兵突击队屠杀时的尖叫声。你发誓要报仇，但在你活着摆脱这种特殊情况之前，你的誓言都是徒劳的。你可以等待突袭结束，使用许可证呼叫增援，或者尝试逃往山上——选择权在你。</VFEE_NewFamily.scenario.parts.14.text>
  <!--EN: An imperial family in dire need of help. A classic VFE - Empire experience.-->
  <VFEE_NewFamily.scenario.summary>一个急需帮助的皇室。经典的 VFE - 帝国体验。</VFEE_NewFamily.scenario.summary>
</LanguageData>
